19
00:06:06,858 --> 00:06:13,508
気付けば…駆けだしていた… 揺れ動く 心のままに…
Before I knew it... I had started running... Following my wavering heart...

20
00:06:14,008 --> 00:06:21,008
遠ざかる…白い壁… 一度も…振り返えずに…
Moving away... from the white wall... Without looking back even once...

21
00:06:21,858 --> 00:06:28,508
《生命》が…消え行く季節の… 胸を刺す…気配の中で…
Inside the sign... of a vanishing season... piercing my heart...

22
00:06:29,008 --> 00:06:35,808
迫る…暗い闇… 二度と…明けないような気がして…
Drawing near... the dark gloom... feeling as though it will never dawn again...

23
00:06:36,008 --> 00:06:43,508
転がり落ちそうな心 必死に抱き止めていた
Desperately holding onto my heart that felt like it was about to tumble down

24
00:06:44,008 --> 00:06:52,008
星空へと続く長い坂道は 永遠にも…思えたから…
Because the long slope leading to the starry sky... felt like it would last forever...

25
00:06:53,008 --> 00:07:06,508
咲く花や…散りぬるを…神代の《時代》より繰り返す… 私はそれを…美しいとは…思ったことがない…
Blooming flowers... and falling petals... repeating since the age of the gods... I have never thought of that... as beautiful...

26
00:07:08,008 --> 00:07:22,508
久方の…春の陽を…仮初の影が奪い合う…その営みを…美しいとは…思ったことがない…
The spring sun of old... contested by transient shadows... I have never thought... that such endeavors are beautiful...

27
00:07:23,008 --> 00:07:32,508
諦めながら生きてきた…何も望まないように…それでも…手放せなかった…
Living while giving up... so as not to hope for anything... Even so... I couldn't let go...

28
00:07:33,008 --> 00:07:38,508
最後の願いを…握りしめて…駆け上がる
Grasping my final wish... I run up.

