00:44:51,677 --> 00:44:53,177
泣いちゃった！
I cried!

296
00:44:53,477 --> 00:44:55,677
このパーティーに終わりはない
This party has no end!

297
00:44:56,177 --> 00:44:58,677
AMAZING HAPPY HALLOWEEN NIGHT

298
00:45:36,118 --> 00:45:40,118
[Title: 狂笑トリックスターズ]
[Title: Kyousou Tricksters]

299
00:45:50,918 --> 00:45:53,918
ようこそ everyone 見なよ恐怖と不気味な spooky night
Welcome everyone, feast your eyes on this spooky, terrifying night...

300
00:45:54,318 --> 00:45:57,118
腹の底まで震え ひだり kick & bass & hats & trumpet
Trembling down to your core, with left kick & bass & hats & trumpet!

301
00:45:57,418 --> 00:46:00,318
ランタンと swingin' beat 赤い靴で踊り狂えば
Dancing wildly in red shoes to the lantern and swingin' beat,

302
00:46:00,618 --> 00:46:04,118
浮世の憂いも忘れられるでしょ
you can forget all the sorrows of this fleeting world, can't you?

303
00:46:04,818 --> 00:46:07,918
近頃噂じゃおばけよりも怖い人達
Word on the street is there are people scarier than ghosts lately—

304
00:46:08,118 --> 00:46:11,418
増えすぎちゃってすぐに 1out, 2out, 3out, KO!!
multiplying so fast: 1 out, 2 out, 3 out, KO!!

305
00:46:12,118 --> 00:46:14,818
コンプライアンスも厳しい目の世の中ですが
In this world where even compliance is strictly watched over,

306
00:46:15,318 --> 00:46:18,318
恐怖のリライト請け負います
we gladly take on rewriting your fears!

307
00:46:18,918 --> 00:46:21,518
