(よん!) いつだって笑顔で (ご!) 油断禁物です
(Four!) Always with a smile (Five!) Let your guard down and you're done!

388
00:56:44,614 --> 00:56:47,614
最後の最後は無事で帰る事♡
And the very last rule is to return home safely♡

389
