Dancing! Dancing! A happy melody in the dark night

395
00:57:09,614 --> 00:57:12,114
ラッタッタ ラッタッタ 冥界 Halloween Night!
Rattatta Rattatta Underworld Halloween Night!

396
00:57:12,114 --> 00:57:15,114
Swinging! Swinging! ぞっとして愉快なアイロニー
Swinging! Swinging! Spooky yet delightful irony

397
00:57:15,614 --> 00:57:18,114
ラッタッタ ラッタッタ 狂宴のショータイム!
Rattatta Rattatta The banquet's showtime!

398
00:57:19,114 --> 00:57:21,614
(Pe Pe Pa) 恐ろしいや (Pa Pa Pa) 不気味しや
(Pe Pe Pa) How terrifying (Pa Pa Pa) How eerie

399
00:57:22,614 --> 00:57:24,614
皆々身の毛もよだつ最後は忘れてる
Everyone forgets the spine-chilling end

400
00:57:25,114 --> 00:57:28,114
(アララ?) (Pe Pe Pa) 美味しそうな (Pa Pa Pa) 楽しんだ者勝ち!
(Oh my?) (Pe Pe Pa) Delicious-looking (Pa Pa Pa) He who enjoys wins!

401
00:57:28,614 --> 00:57:31,114
Welcome! さぁ踊ろうよ This is Halloween Night!
Welcome! Come on and dance, This is Halloween Night!

402
00:57:44,614 --> 00:57:47,114
響きがくった命のチューニング
The tuning of a life gone askew

403
00:57:47,614 --> 00:57:50,614
その不協和音さえも Music (Music)
Even that dissonance is Music (Music)

404
00:57:51,614 --> 00:57:53,814
王室のドアが開け (開き)
The royal doors open (Open)

405
00:57:54,614 --> 00:57:56,814
拍手喝采が起こる 快感です♡
Applause and cheers break out, what a thrill♡

406
00:57:57,614 --> 00:58:00,114
(いっち) ローソクを回して (にー) ドレスを纏って
(One!) Spin the candles (Two!) Put on your dress

407
00:58:00,614 --> 00:58:03,614
(さん!) 女王の私のお出ましです! (きっさぁ!)
(Three!) Her Majesty the Queen makes her entrance! (Yay!)

408
00:58:04,614 --> 00:58:07,114
(よん!) 手を取り合って (ご!) 今日は無礼講で
(Four!) Holding hands (Five!) Today anything goes without ceremony

409
00:58:07,614 --> 00:58:10,114
私に見せられちゃったら最後です♡
Once you're bewitched by me, it's the end♡

410
00:58:11,114 --> 00:58:13,614
艶やかなステップくるり舞ってワルツ
A graceful step, spinning into a waltz

411
00:58:14,114 --> 00:58:17,114
妖鬼夜行のリズムに揺られて
Swaying to the rhythm of the demon night parade

412
00:58:17,614 --> 00:58:21,114
この楽しさ癖になるわ
This fun is becoming a habit

413
00:58:21,614 --> 00:58:23,814
時間切れとか? ヤダ! 全然足りないってば!
Time's up? No way! It's nowhere near enough!

414
00:58:26,614 --> 00:58:28,614
Let's 冥界 Halloween Night!
Let's Underworld Halloween Night!

415
00:58:28,614 --> 00:58:31,114
Dancing! Dancing! 一夜の怪奇なメモリー
Dancing! Dancing! A bizarre memory of a single night

416
00:58:31,614 --> 00:58:34,114
ラッタッタ ラッタッタ 冥界 Halloween Night!
Rattatta Rattatta Underworld Halloween Night!

417
00:58:34,614 --> 00:58:37,614
Sweety! Sweety! おめかしに頬張るキャンディー
Sweety! Sweety! Nibbling on candy while all dressed up

418
00:58:38,614 --> 00:58:41,114
ラッタッタ ラッタッタ あぁもっと頂戴!
Rattatta Rattatta Ah, give me more!

419
00:58:42,614 --> 00:58:48,114
泡沫の夢 浅い霧の中溶けて ああ 白い頬を涙が伝った
An ephemeral dream melting in the shallow mist, Ah, tears traced down my pale cheeks

420
00:58:54,614 --> 00:59:01,114
この夜来ては 誰の為? 呪文呪い共の 進むべき禁断の箱を開けたら
Who is this night for? When you open the forbidden box of spells and curses

421
00:59:05,614 --> 00:59:10,114
時間を戻す 魔法使っちゃおうかな!
Shall I use magic to turn back time?!

422
00:59:14,114 --> 00:59:16,614
Dancing! Dancing! 闇夜にハッピーなメロディー
Dancing! Dancing! A happy melody in the dark night

423
00:59:17,614 --> 00:59:20,114
ラッタッタ ラッタッタ 冥界 Halloween Night!
Rattatta Rattatta Underworld Halloween Night!

424
00:59:20,614 --> 00:59:23,114
