Swinging! Swinging! Spooky yet delightful irony

425
00:59:23,614 --> 00:59:26,114
ラッタッタ ラッタッタ 狂宴のショータイム!
Rattatta Rattatta The banquet's showtime!

426
00:59:27,114 --> 00:59:29,614
(Pe Pe Pa) 恐ろしいや (Pa Pa Pa) 不気味しや
(Pe Pe Pa) How terrifying (Pa Pa Pa) How eerie

427
00:59:30,614 --> 00:59:32,614
皆々身の毛もよだつ最後は忘れてる
