428
00:59:33,114 --> 00:59:36,114
(アララ?) (Pe Pe Pa) 美味しそうな (Pa Pa Pa) 楽しんだ者勝ち!
(Oh my?) (Pe Pe Pa) Delicious-looking (Pa Pa Pa) He who enjoys wins!

429
00:59:36,614 --> 00:59:39,114
Welcome! さぁ踊ろうよ This is Halloween Night!
Welcome! Come on and dance, This is Halloween Night!

430
01:00:02,231 --> 01:00:04,551
ハロウィンパーティ、いかがでしたでしょうか？
How was the Halloween party?

431
01:00:05,051 --> 01:00:08,611
ちゃんとこちら側の王国に戻って来られてますか？
Have you made it safely back to this side's kingdom?

432
01:00:09,171 --> 01:00:16,211
冥界の女王様にお気に召されてしまうと、魂を奪われてしまって帰って来られませんからね。
If you catch the Underworld Queen's fancy, she'll steal your soul and you won't be able to come back, you know.

433
01:00:16,551 --> 01:00:20,651
戻って来られてラッキーでした、なんて。
Lucky you made it back, huh? Hehe.

434
01:00:22,171 --> 01:00:25,911
今日のお話はどうでしたか？楽しかったでしょうか？
How did you like today's story? Was it fun?

435
01:00:26,371 --> 01:00:33,611
私がいちばんお気に入りは探偵のお話でして、今回お届けできてとても嬉しかったです。
My personal favorite was the detective story, and I'm so glad we could share it this time.

436
01:00:34,291 --> 01:00:37,831
そうだ、いつかあなたのお話も聞かせてくださいね。
Oh right, please let me hear your story sometime too.

437
01:00:38,271 --> 01:00:43,731
もしかすると、あの本にあなたのお話も書き記されるかもしれませんよ。
Who knows, your story might be written down in that book too.

438
01:00:44,451 --> 01:00:53,271
なんと言っても、魔か不思議な本ですから、何が起こるか死者である私にも分かりません。
After all, since it's a mysterious magical book, even I as a dead soul don't know what will happen.

439
01:00:53,811 --> 01:00:56,431
さて、そろそろお時間ですね。
Now, it's almost time.

440
01:00:56,871 --> 01:01:04,131
またお話が聞きたくなりましたら、いつでもこの王国図書館へお越しください。
If you ever want to hear stories again, please come visit this Underworld Library anytime.

441
01:01:04,611 --> 01:01:06,351
それでは、さようなら。
Well then, farewell.

442
01:01:19,427 --> 01:01:26,627
ハジマリはきっとひとつの願い それを抱いて私たちは 生まれた孤独な夜空 震える指で 天と地をつなげよう
A beginning is surely a single wish. Embracing that, we were born into the lonely night sky. With trembling fingers, let's connect the heavens and the earth.

443
01:01:45,395 --> 01:01:52,795
さあ ほら 瞳の奥を上げて みんなで手を繋げば
Come on, raise your gaze, if we hold hands together—

444
01:01:53,035 --> 01:01:58,595
まだまだ未知の途中 世界を越えよう
We're still in the unknown, let's transcend the world!

445
01:01:58,995 --> 01:02:05,415
さあ ほら 星々が牙を剥こうと 止まらない静欲だから
Come on, even if the stars bare their fangs, our passion is unstoppable!

446
01:02:05,615 --> 01:02:11,155
夢を書き換えたら 追いかけ続けよう
Once we rewrite our dreams, let's keep chasing them!

447
01:02:11,455 --> 01:02:17,735
止まらず繋がる パンパレ Go!
Unstoppable, connecting fanfare, Go!

448
01:02:17,735 --> 01:02:23,195
なかなか見えない姿 自分自身の輝きを失った 鍵には思い出してね
Paint it—whether you... when you lost your own radiance, remember the key.

449
01:02:26,995 --> 01:02:31,695
僕らのセイバー 君がいるから 輝く
Our savior, because you're here, we shine!

450
01:02:37,695 --> 01:02:41,995
La La La La La

451
01:02:42,695 --> 01:02:47,695
無数の星の中から 光が君がくれた
From countless stars, the light you gave me...

452
01:02:50,195 --> 01:02:55,195
もっと越えていけるさ スーパーノヴァを起こせ今
We can go even further beyond, trigger a supernova right now!

453
01:02:56,195 --> 01:03:01,695
何度だって飛べる これは何億光年の奇跡 High Five!
We can fly no matter how many times. This is a miracle of hundreds of millions of light-years. High Five!

454
01:03:06,695 --> 01:03:14,695
Bestest Wish! スコン部！
Bestest Wish! Sukonbu!

